# Third-party notices

## Word lists

Generated by `scripts/generate-wordlists.py` from:

- [dwyl/english-words](https://github.com/dwyl/english-words) (`words_alpha.txt`) — Unlicense / public domain word corpus

Words are filtered to A–Z ASCII, grouped by length (5–10). Answers are a higher-frequency subset; guesses include all answers plus a broader pool.

## Dependencies

See `gradle/libs.versions.toml` for pinned versions:

- Kotlin, Compose Multiplatform, kotlinx-coroutines, kotlinx-serialization, kotlinx-datetime
- Roborazzi (desktop screenshot tests)
- Playwright (web E2E/screenshots)

## Fonts

UI uses platform serif/sans stacks. Optional bundled editorial fonts (Fraunces, Source Sans 3) may be added under `composeResources/font/`.
